 "brief": "Residents of Salfit governorate held a funeral Thursday evening for Mashhour Yaseen, 51, who was shot dead by settlers outside his home in Yasuf town, Shehab Wire reported. The shooting occurred while Yaseen stood in front of his residence in the eastern part of the governorate.\n\nA funeral procession moved from a local mosque to carry Yaseen to his grave.",
